{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/016-gan-tang/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/016-gan-tang/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/data.json","title":"詩經注析 · 甘棠 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 召南 · 甘棠 · 汇集《詩經注析》关于《甘棠》的 17 条注释，含 17 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"016-gan-tang","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/016-gan-tang/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","poem":{"id":"016-gan-tang","title":"甘棠","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"shaonan","path":["風","召南","甘棠"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"蔽芾甘棠","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"勿剪勿伐","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"召伯所茇","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"蔽芾甘棠","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"勿剪勿败","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"召伯所憩","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"蔽芾甘棠","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"勿剪勿拜","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"召伯所说","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","title":"詩經注析","authors":["程俊英","蔣見元"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","era":"现代","publicationYear":1991,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":17,"glossCount":17},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":17,"layer":"preface","layerLabel":"篇序","targetText":"东迁，颇著功绩，人们作甘棠一诗怀念他。诗当作于召伯死后，其年代约在东周初年。按司马迁史记燕召公世家说：“召公卒，而民人思召公之政，怀棠树不敢伐，歌咏之，作甘棠之诗。”自此以后，人们都认为甘棠是歌颂召公奭的诗。不知史公误信韩诗。韩诗外传：“诗人见召伯之所休息树下，美而歌之，诗曰……”韩婴以召伯为召公奭，致有此误。","targetNotes":"题解第一段。","sourceLabel":"第 30 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 30 甘棠题解第一段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"题解"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":17,"layer":"preface","layerLabel":"篇序","targetText":"此诗通过“勿伐”、“勿败”、“勿拜”三语，显示出对甘棠的爱情，从而表达了人民对召伯的思念。从字面上看，从“伐”（砍伐）到“败”（摧毁），到“拜”（拔掉），对树的伤害愈来愈重，但由于前面加了一个“勿”字，其要求反愈来愈严，对甘棠的情意也显得愈来愈重，表现了诗人对召伯的热爱。方玉润道：“他诗炼字，一层深一层，此诗一层轻一层，然以轻而愈见珍重耳。”（诗经原始）方氏长于分析，短于训诂，盲从宋儒之说，故有此失。","targetNotes":"题解第二段。","sourceLabel":"第 30 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 30 甘棠题解第二段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"题解"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿伐，召伯所茇。","targetNotes":"首章原文。","sourceLabel":"第 30 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 30 首章原文。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"首章"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿伐，召伯所茇。","targetNotes":"首章注条：蔽芾。","sourceLabel":"第 30 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 30 首章注条 蔽芾。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"首章注"}]},{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿伐，召伯所茇。","targetNotes":"首章注条：甘棠。","sourceLabel":"第 30 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 30 首章注条 甘棠。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"首章注"}]},{"id":"0006","order":6,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿伐，召伯所茇。","targetNotes":"首章注条：剪。","sourceLabel":"第 30 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 30 首章注条 剪。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0006-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"首章注"}]},{"id":"0007","order":7,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿伐，召伯所茇。","targetNotes":"首章注条：召伯。","sourceLabel":"第 30 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 30 首章注条 召伯。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0007-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"首章注"}]},{"id":"0008","order":8,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿伐，召伯所茇。","targetNotes":"首章注条：茇。","sourceLabel":"第 30 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 30 首章注条 茇。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0008-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"首章注"}]},{"id":"0009","order":9,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"韵读：祭部——伐、茇。","targetNotes":"首章韵读。","sourceLabel":"第 30 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 30 首章韵读。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0009-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"韵读"}]},{"id":"0010","order":10,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿败，召伯所憩。","targetNotes":"次章原文。","sourceLabel":"第 31 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 31 次章原文。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0010-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"次章"}]},{"id":"0011","order":11,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿败，召伯所憩。","targetNotes":"次章注条：败。","sourceLabel":"第 31 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 31 次章注条 败。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0011-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"次章注"}]},{"id":"0012","order":12,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿败，召伯所憩。","targetNotes":"次章注条：憩。","sourceLabel":"第 31 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 31 次章注条 憩。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0012-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"次章注"}]},{"id":"0013","order":13,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"韵读：祭部——败、憩。","targetNotes":"次章韵读。","sourceLabel":"第 31 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 31 次章韵读。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0013-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"韵读"}]},{"id":"0014","order":14,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿拜，召伯所说。","targetNotes":"三章原文。","sourceLabel":"第 31 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 31 三章原文。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0014-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"三章"}]},{"id":"0015","order":15,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿拜，召伯所说。","targetNotes":"三章注条：拜。","sourceLabel":"第 31 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 31 三章注条 拜。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0015-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"三章注"}]},{"id":"0016","order":16,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蔽芾甘棠，勿剪勿拜，召伯所说。","targetNotes":"三章注条：说。","sourceLabel":"第 31 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 31 三章注条 说。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0016-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"三章注"}]},{"id":"0017","order":17,"total":17,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targ